# NIL Workspace — Build Rules

## Before Every Build

Read and internalize these skills (in `.cursor/skills/`):
- `nil-design-system/SKILL.md` — tokens, glass, springs, density
- `nil-anti-slop/SKILL.md` — forbidden patterns, verification
- `nil-components/SKILL.md` — component primitives (bits-ui)
- `nil-motion/SKILL.md` — spring curves, reduced-motion
- `nil-typography/SKILL.md` — Inter + JetBrains Mono rules
- `nil-terminal-ui/SKILL.md` — terminal-first IA, AI strip states
- `nil-agent-patterns/SKILL.md` — agent loop UI blocks
- `nil-reference-workflow/SKILL.md` — reference-first methodology
- `nil-plugins/SKILL.md` — plugin system types
- `nil-tauri/SKILL.md` — Tauri 2 integration

## Mandatory Checks Before Commit

```bash
cd frontend && npm run check && npm run build
```

Both MUST pass. No exceptions.

## Token Audit

```bash
# No inline hex colors anywhere except app.css
grep -r "#[0-9a-fA-F]\{3,8\}" frontend/src --include="*.svelte" --include="*.css" | grep -v "app.css"
# Should return NOTHING
```

## Shadow Audit

```bash
grep -r "box-shadow" frontend/src --include="*.svelte" --include="*.css" | grep -v "app.css"
# Should return NOTHING
```

## Easing Audit

```bash
grep -r "ease\|linear\|cubic-bezier" frontend/src --include="*.svelte" --include="*.css" | grep -v "spring\|app.css"
# Should return NOTHING
```

## Reduced Motion Test

1. Enable "Reduce Motion" in OS settings
2. Reload app
3. Verify ALL animations stop instantly
4. Information still readable (pending blocks visible, etc.)

## Mobile Test

Test at: 320px, 375px, 414px, 768px width
- No horizontal overflow
- Touch targets ≥28px (not 44px)
- Text readable at 16px base

## Contrast Audit

Chrome DevTools → Elements → Accessibility → Contrast
- All text ≥4.5:1 on abyss surfaces
- Large text (18px+) ≥3:1

## Focus Visibility

Tab through entire UI — every interactive element must show:
- 2px `--accent-primary` ring
- 2px offset
- Never blue browser default

## Anti-Slop Quick Check

- [ ] No chat bubbles
- [ ] No fake terminal chrome ($ prompts)
- [ ] No emoji in product UI
- [ ] No generic "Message AI..." hero copy
- [ ] No glass on every surface (max 2)
- [ ] No second WebGL context
- [ ] No CSS traffic lights
- [ ] No two settings surfaces
- [ ] No findings duplicated
- [ ] No inline hex values
- [ ] No box-shadow
- [ ] No linear easing
- [ ] No margin stacks (use gap)

